<section class="story rv">
  <h2><span class="mono">05</span>Beyond Google: AI answers</h2>
  <div class="txt">
    <p>Because the key pages were structured to answer questions clearly, and the brand was being mentioned by trusted German publications, it started appearing in AI-generated answers and recommendations for paint-by-numbers queries in Germany and neighbouring markets.</p>
    <blockquote class="quote">Ranking well and being cited by AI now come from the same work: clear answers, strong entities and real authority.</blockquote>
  </div>
</section>

